+**Asked for by the human, 2026-10-13:** enrich the READMEs of the three
+packages published at 0.7.1 (`jet_cad_2d`, `jet_cad_2d_flutter`,
+`jet_cad_floor_plan`): links between them and to the host guide, which
+package a host installs, screenshots of the visual widgets produced by a
+command that stays in the repository, and support links (GitHub Sponsors,
+Buy Me a Coffee).
