+## Exit gate
+
+- CLAUDE.md's three package gates green (the planner's includes D9's
+  test); `tool/screenshots` test, analyze and format clean;
+  `tool/readme_probe` analyze and format clean.
+- `cd tool/ci && dart test`; `dart run tool/ci/check_guide.dart`,
+  `check_readmes.dart` and `check_screenshots.dart` green.
+- `dart pub publish --dry-run` in each of the three packages: 0 warnings;
+  archive sizes before and after recorded.
+- The screenshots regenerated by D4's command on this branch, and the
+  results note saying on which machine and Flutter.
+- `analysis_options.yaml` never committed.
+- An Opus subagent reviews the whole branch; its findings are applied or
+  ruled on in the results note.
